# gammastep. The atom is x11-misc/* for redshift-fork reasons, but the session
# is wayland-only here.
#
#   wayland   the wlr-gamma-control-unstable-v1 backend. Without it only the
#             X11 randr/vidmode methods are built and gammastep exits with
#             "no protocol" under mango and sway.
#  -geoclue   location is manual in ~/.config/gammastep/config.ini; geoclue is
#             a D-Bus service that reaches the network for it.
#  -gtk       the tray indicator (and its python dep). The waybar
#             custom/gammastep module is what toggles it here.
x11-misc/gammastep wayland -geoclue -gtk
